ronment and compare the unchanged base revision; Classify runner qualification separately from product admission without treating failed or unavailable measurements as passes; Fix only the demonstrated cause and preserve every latency and RSS ratchet unless an explicitly reviewed platform correction is supported; Add positive and negative regression controls proving real command regressions still fail and any runner refusal is explicit"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-o87av6"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A qualified runner passes unchanged supported-runtime startup budgets, and genuine command regressions remain fail-closed with attributable evidence."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Two transport-floor runs failed fixed latency ceilings across changing commands; independent SDK import rerun passed. The broad static invocation therefore cannot be reported all green."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-o87av6","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-p9a4","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-yse5dt","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-28T06:20:35.648Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"text: Duplicate check 2026-09-28: inspected the complete all-status corpus for startup, latency, entrypoint and benchmark owners and ran the live all-status CLI startup budget search. The completed transport-floor owner pm-yse5dt remains closed: its ten-sample im